RG DS OS: the vibration motor's PWM at 25 kHz instead of 10 kHz

At 10 kHz the motor coil sings audibly whenever it is driven below full duty (every menu tap); 25 kHz is above
hearing. The duty, and so the strength, is unchanged.

--- a/rk3568-anbernic-rg-ds.dts	2026-10-26 22:11:36
+++ b/rk3568-anbernic-rg-ds.dts	2026-10-26 22:11:36
@@ -52,7 +52,7 @@
 		pinctrl-names = "default";
 		pinctrl-0 = <&gamepad_keys_l>;
 
-		pwms = <&pwm14 0 100000 0>;
+		pwms = <&pwm14 0 40000 0>;
 		pwm-names = "enable";
 		rumble-boost-weak = <0x00>;
 		rumble-boost-strong = <0x00>;
